<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Nutreco.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Nutreco.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nutreco Holding NV was rated a &quot;recommended list&quot; stock as Goldman Sachs initiated coverage, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
